Scientific Attribution & Foundational Code:

1. GPU Parallelization & Tumoral Dosimetry Model:
   N. López-Marín, F. Corrales-Machín, E. Castro-Alvarez, and R. Rodríguez-Fernández,
   "Light Transport in Biological Tissues Using GPU,"
   Revista Cubana de Física, Vol. 33, No. 2, pp. 122–126 (2016).

   F. Corrales Machín, "Simulación del transporte de luz en una capa de tejido
   utilizando el método de Monte Carlo," B.Sc. Thesis, Facultad de Física,
   Universidad de La Habana (2015).

2. Original MCML Code:
   Copyright (c) 1992 University of Texas M.D. Anderson Cancer Center
   Developed by Lihong Wang, Ph.D. and Steven L. Jacques, Ph.D.
   L.-H. Wang, S. L. Jacques, and L.-Q. Zheng,
   "MCML — Monte Carlo modeling of photon transport in multi-layered tissues,"
   Computer Methods and Programs in Biomedicine, 47(2), 131–146 (1995).
